{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33088","headline":"哭彭先生 · 储嗣宗","name":"哭彭先生","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"谷口溪声客自伤，那堪呜咽吊残阳。\n空阶鹤恋丹青影，秋雨苔封白石牀。\n主祭孤儿初学语，无媒旅榇未还乡。\n门人远赴心丧夜，月满千山旧草堂。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"储嗣宗","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33088.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33088","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}